Package Version 3.0.5
Dated: 04-06-2019
1. Improved the validity check code to minimize the memory allocation.
2. Implemented firmware update with secure header in the begining of the firmware image
and signature in the end.
3. version and model sting is added into the security header.
4. backward compatibility has been kept to support the firmware update from the older
image format until the newer format is rolled-up.

Package Version 3.0.4
Dated: 28-05-2019
1. Redmine #22143: Coding error while verifying signature
2. Added return codes for signature failure
3. Removing files after signature failure

Package Version 3.0.3
Dated: 27-05-2019
1. Redmine #22100: Fixed the socket response going to default switch condition
2. Redmine #22086: Copy using image name to /tmp location instead of using *.img
3. Optimizations - initialising pointers to NULL, removed duplication of client FOTA_WS condition verification 

Package Version 3.0.2
Dated: 07-05-2019
1. Fixed returned codes in check_image_validity() function
2. Freeing buffer and context when the image validation fails
3. Fixed the scenario where download_status is left enabled when the hub is turned off while performing check for update 

Package Version 3.0.1
Dated: 06-05-2019
1. Redmine #21912: Added firmware signature verification with SHA-256 and RSA-1024.

Package Version 3.0.0
Dated: 03-05-2019
1. Redmine #21753: Fota online update wherein interface with Mobile Agent is removed
2. Introduced UDP socket communication with Websocket and Device Manager
3. Integrated code for thub and end device firmware update

Package Version 2.0.0
Dated: 23-04-2019

1. Redmine #21233: Introduced new feature - end device firmware update

Package Version 1.1.0
Dated: 24-09-2018

1. Redmine #19105, #19116, #19120, #19121, #19123 and #19135.
2. Now passing last installed (in dnld_firmware_info.json) and min app version (in shifu_version.json) details to Mobile Agent.

Package Version 1.0.4

1. Added "JSON_PATH" key in version.json file for modifying between fota.json and fota_dev.json
2. URL made dynamic fetching from version.json
3. Added "created_at" key in update.json file for fetching image uploaded timestamp.
4. Included release date timestamp in FCM Push.

Package Version 1.0.2

1. Downloads from fixed URL "https://d10fcns44yeyj9.cloudfront.net/json-file/fota.json"
2. change log url and image url are fetched from above path.
3. Validates image and performs FCM push accordingly.
4. Call /usr/bin/fota_upadte D for above functionality.
5. Call /usr/bin/fota_update U for initiating upgrade process.
6. Checksum status is made null
7. Upgrade status is made 1
8. Added update.json config file
9. Added version.json config file
